{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05457","headline":"江行纪事二首 二 · 席豫","name":"江行纪事二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江汛春风势，山楼曙月辉。\n猿攀紫岩饮，鸟拂清潭飞。\n古树崩沙岸，新苔覆石矶。\n津途赏无限，征客蹔忘归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席豫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05457.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05457","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}